      "statement": "Terraform splits the class object into three resources: zia_bandwidth_classes (urls, url_categories, web_applications; no type or applications field), zia_bandwidth_classes_file_size (defaults type to BANDWIDTH_CAT_LARGE_FILE) and zia_bandwidth_classes_web_conferencing (type BANDWIDTH_CAT_WEBCONF or BANDWIDTH_CAT_VOIP, plus applications).",
